(51, 'NFI Essentials Makeup Organizer Box Makeup Kit Box Makeup Vanity Box Cosmetic Box for Women Bridal Makeup Storage Box for Beauty and Jewellery Case', 'nfi-essentials-makeup-organizer-box-makeup-kit-box-makeup-vanity-box-cosmetic-box-for-women-bridal-makeup-storage-box-for-beauty-and-jewellery-case', 'The material is composed of inner velvet and polyurethane. Water-resistant, lightweight, long-lasting, and easily cleaned Elegant and fashionable jewelry organizer box, extra-large makeup organizer box One mirror and a double-layer design make cosmetics application simple This makeup bag can hold all of your cosmetics, including foundation, eye shadow, lipsticks, mascara, eyeliner, powder, concealer, nail polish, and essential oils. Excellent professional beauty case, ideal for beginners or makeup artists. Dimensions : 23.5x18.5x11cm (Length x Width x Height); Contents: Makeup Box. Convenient Design Keeping your beauty supplies organized is possible with a hand strap. You may modify the unique design as needed. You can carry it with you wherever you go, making it the ideal travel accessory. Wonderful presents for Mother\'s Day, Valentine\'s Day, birthdays, weddings, anniversaries, Diwali, Christmas, or just to give to loved ones. Additionally, you may carry it with you wherever you go, which will increase your convenience. Stylish and Sturdy Design: This cosmetic bag, which is made of premium, water-resistant material, blends style and utility to make it a dependable travel companion or a chic addition to your dressing table.\r\n\r\n', 69.00, 'Makeup', '1787404861504-102192684.webp', '2026-08-22 13:21:01', 56, '[\"1787404861505-685343974.webp\"]', '2026-08-22 13:21:01', NULL),
(52, 'Aakarsha Petite Kurtis', 'aakarsha-petite-kurtis', 'Aakarsha Petite Kurtis are stylish, comfortable, and perfect for everyday wear. Designed with elegant patterns and a flattering fit, these kurtis offer a chic look for casual outings, work, and special occasions.\r\n', 276.00, 'Meesho', '1788867909398-501966595.webp', '2026-09-08 11:45:09', 22, '[\"1788867909398-433164443.webp\",\"1788867909398-273122987.webp\",\"1788867909398-954917893.webp\",\"1788867909398-264489287.webp\"]', '2026-09-08 12:14:43', 'https://chatgpt.com/c/6a9ff4dd-d574-83e8-b083-426be3e9afed');

